// spec/fees/conversion.md, "A run needs the published Worker, a fresh run identity and a free or expired lease"; spec/fees/conversion.md, "Each evaluation records one outcome from the pinned order of checks"; spec/fees/runtime.md, "Signing needs a live mode and owner-verified readiness for the exact wallet"; spec/fees/composition.md, "Buyback income is a finalized USDC claim, a finalized conversion output, a booked direct-award fee or a kept submission fee"; spec/fees/buybackBinding.md, "Every buyback send is a row of its network's fee journal and shares its lease, nonce floor and native reservation"
